  "label": "Soviet Union",
  "description": "A former country that existed from 1922 to 1991, characterized by a totalitarian communist regime under the leadership of the Communist Party. The Soviet Union is historically associated with state control, suppression of dissent, censorship, and authoritarian governance, which are the core concepts invoked by the 'Soviet Amerika' meme. The term 'Soviet' is used here as a pejorative to imply oppressive state control.",
